QuestGuidance.Register("es",170,{
[5409]="7006559F\n1\tDefeat woods snipers (total: 8)\030Defeat forest prowlers (total: 4)\030Defeat a bandit captain\tIrzeben has asked you to defeat the growing bandit threat in the woods south of Furukzahar. The woods are in northern Lower Lebennin.\n2\tReturn to Irzeben\tYou should let Irzeben know that you have defeated many of the bandits in the forest south of Furukzahar. Irzeben is in the Zarsatrâd.\n",
[5410]="7004A8F1\n1\tBurn slain Orcs at Durthang in Lhingris (total: 8)\tSlain Orcs can be found littering the road leading to Durthang in Lhingris. You have noticed that burning the dead of Durthang has worked to repel the spiders of Lhingris. You should burn slain Orcs to fend off the spiders of Lhingris.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have burned many of the slain Orcs at the gates of Durthang in Lhingris.\n",
[5411]="70062DD7\n1\tDerrota enemigos dentro de Caras Gelebren (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar enemigos por todas las ruinas de Caras Gelebren.\n2\tHabla con Ilarion en Echad Terthas\tIlarion está en Echad Terthas.\n",
[5412]="7005A498\n1\tCollect poisoned arrows (total: 12)\030Defeat enemies at Rung-shakam (total: 12)\030Collect poison pouches (total: 4)\tRung-shakam is located in north-western Azanulbizar. You should collect poisoned arrows and poison pouches in Rung-shakam.\n2\tReturn to Edash\tEdash is located in Amdân. Bring the arrows and pouches to Edash.\n",
[5413]="7006B88D\n1\tDefeat Orc scouts (total: 8)\tUsing the information from the scouting report gathered from Irkiri, Galâmka has asked you to clear out Orc scouts in the area to the south-east to prevent them from finding the camp.\n2\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have eliminated the Orc scouts.\n",
[5414]="7003A663\n1\tFind the ford north of Flodgeheld\tThe winding Swiftwater River has a shallow ford north of Flodgeheld where the cliff walls dip down into steep but climbable banks along the river; however, they quickly rise up into a canyon just beyond that.\n2\tFind evidence of the White Hand's passing\tA footprint can be seen in the grass on the other side of the ford. It was likely made by the White Hand that were suspected to have come through here recently.\n3\tFind more evidence\tIt seems likely that more footprints were made which could help indicate which direction they went. You should search the land as it rises north of the river for more footprints.\n4\tFind more evidence\tThe grass grows thick as the ground rises from the river, and it may be harder to follow the trail of the White Hand. You will need to search for more evidence to determine which direction they went.\n5\tScout Mate Isernore\tThe party of White Hand that crossed the river appeared to lead in the direction of one of Gifemund's mines, Mate Isernore.\n6\tHabla con Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst. You have much to tell Herubrand, with your efforts in Brockbridge, the situations in Flodgeheld and Madh-fushaum, and more recently what you found in Mate Isernore.\n",
[5415]="70071777\n1\tFind the footprints Rhadrog mentioned\tThough the gait of the tracks implies that they were not made by a soldier or bandit, Rhadrog is curious about who else may be roaming this barren land. He has asked you to take a look at the footprints for yourself, and he will assure Khagâmi's safety.\n2\tExamina las huellas\tYou have found the footprints of which Rhadrog spoke. You should follow them and see where they lead.\n3\tFollow the trail of footprints\tYou have found the footprints of which Rhadrog spoke. You should follow them and see where they lead.\n4\tHabla con Faeron\tYou have found the footprints of which Rhadrog spoke and followed them to this road. For some reason, Faeron is here? You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[5416]="70039F1D\n1\tLocaliza el tótem de jabalí\tEl Thane Sparhafoc quiere que busques este tótem de jabalí en los pantanos. Tova mencionó que estaba justo al sureste de Frontera de los Pantanos.\n2\tInvestiga el tótem de jabalí\tHas localizado el tótem de jabalí en los pantanos. Acércate y examina el tótem.\n3\tDerrota a los orcos atacantes (total: 4)\tAl investigar el tótem de jabalí, un grupo de Orcos ataca. Derrota a los Orcos atacantes.\n4\tHabla con el Thane Sparhafoc\tNo hay muchas dudas en tu mente de que los Orcos atacantes están conectados con los tótems de jabalí encontrados alrededor del Folde Este. Regresa con el Thane Sparhafoc e infórmale de tus hallazgos.\n",
[5417]="70032DDA\n1\tExamina la pureza del agua en el Salón del Agua que Fluye\tEl agua puede ser probada en cualquiera de los cascadas en el Salón del Agua que fluye. Deberías usar el vial para tomar muestras de agua en Zelem-melek.\n2\tEl agua puede ser probada en cualquiera de los depósitos en los pasillos adyacentes al Salón del Agua que fluye. Deberías usar el vial para tomar muestras de agua en Zelem-melek.\t\n3\tBusca cerca del Salón del Agua que Fluye más fuentes de agua\tPuede que haya otras fuentes de agua cerca del Salón del Agua que fluye. Deberías buscar cerca del Salón del Agua que fluye más fuentes de agua para tomar muestras.\n4\tVuelve a ver a Búi para contarle qué has descubierto\tBúi está en el Salón del Agua que fluye, en el centro de Zelem-melek. Deberías volver a ver a Búi y contarle lo que has descubierto.\n",
[5418]="700529CE\n1\tHabla con Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n2\tFind evidence of the attackers' identities\tThere should be some evidence near Ainhard's home that can confirm who the attackers were. You should find evidence of the attackers' identities.\n3\tInvestiga los rastros\tLanghár has identified goblin tracks near Ainhard's home. You should investigate the goblin tracks.\n4\tDefeat the ambushers\tWhile investigating the tracks outside Ainhard's home, you were ambushed by goblins! You should defeat the goblins.\n5\tExamine the scrap of paper\tThe goblin ambushers near Ainhard's home appear to have dropped a scrap of paper. You should examine the paper.\n6\tHabla con Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n7\tTalk to Ainhard\tAinhard's Homestead lies south of Vegbár. in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Ainhard.\n8\tHelp Ainhard with 'Hounds in the Woods'\030Help Langhár with 'Picking up the Pieces'\030Help Langhár with 'Lurking Looters'\tAinhard's Homestead lies south of Vegbár. in the Wolf-denes. You should complete quests to help Ainhard.\n9\tTalk to Ainhard\tAinhard's Homestead lies south of Vegbár. in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Ainhard.\n10\tHabla con Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n",
[5419]="70015E17\n1\tBusca en el campamento señales del paso de la Compañía\tEl campamento se encuentra al este y al norte de Echad Eregion, más allá de Torech Bornagol y Torech Carangor. Golgallon te ha pedido que busques en otro campamento señales del paso de la Compañía.\n2\tHabla con Golgallon en Echad Eregion\tGolgallon está en Echad Eregion, al oeste y al sur del campamento, más allá de Torech Carangor y Torech Bornagol. Debes regresar con Golgallon y advertirle que el campamento ha sido perturbado y que se han llevado algo.\n",
[5420]="7003766F\n1\tFollow the rivulet to see if it is safe\tThe rivulet running north to south in the Westfold branches west towards Helm's Deep. You should patrol the banks to see if this is a safe path for the refugees to follow, as the roads do not seem so promising.\n2\tFollow the rivulet southwards to see if it is safe\tThe rivulet running north to south in the Westfold branches west towards Helm's Deep. You should patrol the banks to see if this is a safe path for the refugees to follow, as the roads do not seem so promising.\n3\tContinue to follow the rivulet south-west\tThe rivulet running north to south in the Westfold branches west towards Helm's Deep. You should patrol the banks to see if this is a safe path for the refugees to follow, as the roads do not seem so promising.\n4\tContinue to follow the rivulet west\tThe rivulet running north to south in the Westfold branches west towards Helm's Deep. You should patrol the banks to see if this is a safe path for the refugees to follow, as the roads do not seem so promising.\n5\tCompletado\tYou have scouted the river, and it seems to be the safest route of all.\n",
[5421]="7005B229\n1\tExamine the supply area in Aslíf\tNáin has tasked you with tracking down the scout Múta, who was investigating missing supplies. Examining the supply area on the lower level of Aslíf should be the first step to solving this mystery.\n2\tYou have found scratch marks near the supply area in Aslíf. Following the scratch marks may help you find Múta.\t\n3\tTalk to Múta at Gabil-memâg\tYou have found Múta at Gabil-memâg. You should talk to her.\n",
[5422]="7002D4A2\n1\tHabla con Thalfar en su campamento\tThalfar se encuentra en el campamento minero central de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, al sur del campamento de Descenso Profundo. Deberías hablar con Thalfar en su campamento minero.\n",
[5423]="7002D537\n1\tEncuentra la puerta oculta en los pasadizos del sur\tSori mencionó una puerta secreta situada en los pasadizos del sur de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata que te ayudaría a seguir al enano Öndótt. Deberías buscar en el túnel del sur la puerta secreta que conduce a la antigua ciudad enana.\n2\tEncuentra a Öndótt en la Vieja Ciudad del Cuerno de Plata\tÖndótt se encuentra en la antigua ciudad enana abandonada de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata. Deberías buscar a Öndótt y hablar con él.\n",
[5424]="70066E87\n1\tComplete 'Upokhir's Allies'\030Complete 'Rescue at Pahor Boha'\030Complete 'Scouting Pahor Boha'\tTorthril has asked you to help Upokhir and his allies within Pahor Boha. Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tTalk to Upokhir\tYou to have aided completed the tasks that Torthril and Upokhir have given you and should speak with them again. Upokhir and Torthril can be found at Ost Arndír.\n",
[5425]="70027100\n1\tHabla con Iestin en el campamento del clan del Jabalí\030Consigue comida de Lhan Colvarn (total: 10)\tLas reservas de comida pueden encontrars een Lhan Colvarn, al norte del campamento del clan del Jabalí. Iestin te ha pedido que le consigas comida y se la lleves a su campamento.\n",
[5426]="7005AAC1\n1\tHelp injured dwarves (total: 6)\tInjured dwarves must be rescued from Borkordh, the drake nest on the south-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Molkha outside Borkordh\tMolkha is scouting outside Borkordh.\n",
[5427]="70041786\n1\tUse the cooking pot to fill the bowls\tThe cooking pot can be found next to Siriel. You should use the cooking pot to fill the bowls with food.\n2\tHungry refugees can be found to the east of Siriel, near the shipyard. You should feed the nearby hungry refugees.\t\n3\tTalk to Siriel\tSiriel is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Siriel.\n",
[5428]="7000703C\n1\tHabla con Mallennor\030Recoge pieles gruesas de uros (total: 6)\030Recoge carne de uros (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar uros en Rhunenlad y Nan Amlug, al este de Esteldín. Mallennor ha sido encargado de proporcionar refugio y comida para los Montaraces de Esteldín y te ha pedido que lo ayudes cazando uros para obtener pieles y carne.\n",
[5429]="7002C9AB\n1\tPlanta las semillas en los terrenos fértiles (total: 7)\tEn Eorlsmead, al sur, junto al Río Limclaro, hay una vieja granja abandonada. Debes plantar las semillas que te ha entregado Tatwine en cualquier terreno de Eorlsmead que parezca fértil.\n2\tVuelve con Tatwine\tTatwine se encuentra en los establos de Stangard. Debes regresar con Tatwine y decirle que has sembrado las semillas, confiando en que la cosecha será próspera en el futuro.\n",
[5430]="70069441\n1\tCompleta los pedidos diarios del Gremio de Cocineros de Umbar (total: 5)\tCompleta las peticiones del Gremio de Cocineros de Umbar. Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Cocineros de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanos de Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tCompletado\tHas completado muchas peticiones de cocinero de Umbar.\n",
[5431]="7002720A\n1\tRecoge reservas de comida (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar reservas de comida en todo Alto Barnavon. Kai te ha pedido que recojas reservas de comida del Clan del Buey y las distribuyas entre el Clan del Jabalí.\n2\tSe pueden encontrar familias hambrientas en todo Bajo Barnavon. Kai te pidió que distribuyeras las reservas de comida entre las familias de Bajo Barnavon.\t\n3\tHabla con Kai en Barnavon\tKai está en Bajo Barnavon. Debes volver con Kai y decirle que has distribuido la comida como él había pedido.\n",
[5432]="70045419\n1\tCollect porridge from the cauldron\tThe cauldron can be found in the War-stead of the Helmingas. You should collect porridge from the cauldron.\n2\tHungry Rohirrim can be found in the War-steads of the Helmingas and the King's Men. You should feed the hungry riders.\t\n3\tCompletado\tYou fed the hungry riders and restored some of their strength, as well as eased their appetites.\n",
[5433]="7005943A\n1\tConsigue peces de las redes de pesca (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar redes de pesca a lo largo de las orillas del Brandivino, cerca del Embarcadero de los Comerciantes. Debes recoger los pescados de las redes de pesca para la Liga del Hacha.\n2\tVuelve con Grun Muellecurvo con el pescado que has conseguido\tGrun Muellecurvo se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes. Deberías volver con Grun Muellecurvo con el pescado que has conseguido.\n",
[5434]="7003A477\n1\tFind the food stores\tThe food-supplies in Madh-fushaum are stored in sacks that are spread out throughout the camp. You should find them and destroy them.\n2\tFind the food-stores\tThe food-supplies in Madh-fushaum are stored in sacks that are spread out throughout the camp. You should find them and destroy them.\n3\tFind a torch\tThe food-supplies in Madh-fushaum are stored in sacks that are spread out throughout the camp. You should find them and destroy them.\n4\tDestroy food-supplies (total: 6)\tThe food-supplies in Madh-fushaum are stored in sacks that are spread out throughout the camp. You should find them and destroy them.\n5\tCompletado\tDestroying the food-stores of this large army will have a devastating effect on its health and morale, unless the leaders of the army can find a new supply soon.\n",
[5435]="7002D505\n1\tEncuentra grano en la zona (total: 6)\tLa comida para el comedero se encuentra en la zona del establo.\n2\tDevuelve el grano al comedero\tEl grano puede colocarse en el comedero dentro del establo del nuevo caballo.\n",
[5436]="7000997F\n1\tDerrota al caudillo de los gigantes de piedra\tEl caudillo de los gigantes de piedra está en Amon Môth, al suroeste de las Agujas de la Linde. Remmenylf te ha pedido derrotar al caudillo de los gigantes de piedra de Amon Môth.\n2\tHabla con Remmenylf en las Agujas de la Linde\tRemmenylf reside en las Agujas de la Linde, al noreste de Amon Môth. Debes regresar con Remmenylf y contarle la derrota del caudillo.\n",
[5437]="700622F6\n1\tHabla con Haerlendir\tTham Celechir puede encontrarse al norte de Idhobel. Rhovandis te ha pedido hablar con Haerlendir justo fuera de Tham Celechir, en el camino.\n2\tBusca jaulas de huargos dentro de Tham Celechir.\tEl explorador te ha informado que los Uruk-hai se han establecido dentro de Tham Celechir. Ten cuidado al investigar las ruinas.\n3\tHabla con Haerlendir\tHas encontrado indicios de actividad de huargos dentro de Tham Celechir. Regresa con Haerlendir, justo fuera de las ruinas al sur de Tham Celechir.\n",
[5438]="7000874D\n1\tReturn to Dâr-gazag and speak with Chieftain Durulkum\030Collect footmen's badges (total: 10)\tSeek footmen, wardens, or scouts throughout the Ettenmoors and slay them. Chieftain Durulkum directed you to seek out the weakest of the enemy soldiers and claim their badges as proof of your duty.\n",
[5439]="70072F8D\n1\tScout north-east Adagím\030Scout eastern Adagím\030Scout south-east Adagím\tMálacál has asked that you travel to east of Sul Madásh, along the ridges, and scout the area for threats.\n2\tReturn to Málacál\tReturn to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your findings after scouting eastern Adagím.\n",
[5440]="7005A692\n1\tCheck on the water-collection buckets\tYou should check on and collect melted snow from Dági's collection buckets. He placed the buckets at a snowy overlook to the south-east of Ashmargathâl, just off the road in Tharkh Shathur.\n2\tExamine the disturbed snow for tracks\tThe collection buckets have been tampered with. Checking the surrounding snow for clues may point you to the right direction.\n3\tTalk to Dági\tDági at Ashmargathâl will want to know about the Orc footprints you found.\n",
})
